    <item>
      <title>记录一下ruoyi框架前端子表时删除按钮不生效的bug</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/2023-10-12-%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8Bruoyi%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%E5%89%8D%E7%AB%AF%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8el-table%E5%81%9A%E5%AD%90%E8%A1%A8%E6%97%B6%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84bug/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Oct 2023 22:00:07 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/2023-10-12-%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8Bruoyi%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%E5%89%8D%E7%AB%AF%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8el-table%E5%81%9A%E5%AD%90%E8%A1%A8%E6%97%B6%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84bug/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;遇到一个奇怪的bug,ruoyi框架前端使用el-table做子表时删除按钮不生效,但是删除后再保存,删除掉的记录并不会存入数据库,所以分析应该是页面渲染的问题。而且只有在新建表单时才会这样。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
